<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-11-02T18:37:28.964Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 18:37:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Drone strikes by the RSF have hit multiple power stations across Sudan, including two in the east, causing widespread blackouts and prompting Sudan to lodge complaints with the UN and African Union against Ethiopia for cross-border attacks. The RSF continues to target civilian infrastructure, while the Sudanese army reports defections of RSF members in Blue Nile state and claims it is recruiting fighters from northern Somalia. The Sudanese government accuses Ethiopia of backing the drone attacks, and the UN is preparing talks with the RSF on a civilian transition. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168703&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxQa2JYemhTSWFJYmZmY1Bob2JzU29fNV9kdmM3Y050RlcwUkJ6WEZXQ2lIbXdMaGFLaVpETzRfTlB1d2ljU3cwOG5CVUdnS0ZJeHhydkpMS0VhU3Q0ZGp0cFZqQjZfQzZUYXhTaEF4c0o4aVIzZUdzTEI0M1BrR3B1TQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE5uVmhDUHlyQVY4V1YtYm1SbFlOVlp0UGZtbkdfMEhZMmxJaHBGaUJOQlVOenp4SDNnakRsOG55cS02SkR0ZzBxS21wT3BhRTNZ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTE9ON0ZzdXhiN2tObndtWExFd05jTWFMQ2RzT19wTWZOTTNGNlBWb1ZFNURZalpaRnZ5MTZINlN5RFlhQVJqejVMX2x2bkxWd21ia2dLTGxMTE9iZkx3RHlrcTBWdXZLVkp2LU1BdDNqR1FBaTg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxPLWdIc19DYlZXdTBpRkdmeUFUOUV1NTNBaUYzaTZQODVjY1dDb2pXVUd3LTVnX3o3U1dXdmktVnlfZzItNFlkbjFaLVpvNEIwVnlJbDNfUTZtb1R2eUhWaTVvVk5QejZCOWR5MEh2d1VaTEs1dDBOREtZUXV